=2 Walkthrough
* Zone into {z:Port Jeuno} for a cutscene.

=2 Notes
* You will be unable to receive this cutscene if you are currently on one of the following missions:
** CoP Mission 3-5 {M:Darkness Named|Promathia Mission 3-5|Darkness Named}
** CoP Mission 5-3 {M:Three Paths|Promathia Mission 5-3|Three Paths}
** CoP Mission 6-4 {M:One to be Feared|Promathia Mission 6-4|One to be Feared}
** CoP Mission 8-4 {p:Dawn|Promathia Mission 8-4} (post-battle final cutscenes)
* You will receive the message "The bonds tying you to Altana have strengthened, enabling you to experience all the memories of Chains of Promathia!"
* You must obtain the Cipher: Prishe II in order to complete the mission. If your inventory was full and you did not receive, check the {p:Mystic Retriever} in Port Jeuno near the guide stone.

=2 Plot Details
* The Reisenjima Orb
** Back in {M:RoV Mission 2-1 (Spirits Awoken)|Spirits Awoken|Spirits Awoken}, {p:Kagero} may have said "This {k:orb|Reisenjima Sanctorium orb} connects the bearer with __a higher power__. Mayhap it will display its true form only to those who open up their hearts to it.", depending on your CoP Mission progress at the time.
** If you had completed {M:CoP chapter 1|The Mothercrystals|The Mothercrystals} __(verification needed)__ before that mission, she would have said instead it connects the bearer with __the Mothercrystal__.
** Some of your {p:Trusts|Category:Trust} are called forth from the orb, filled with its light.
*** Their light/blur visual effect can be toggled on or off with the command **/localsettings blureffect [on/off]**.

